licazioni\",\"categoryId\":13,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/microsoft-office-2021-768x410.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"microsoft-office-2021\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15253,\"date\":\"2026-06-01T12:00:38+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-31T22:38:48+00:00\",\"slug\":\"nuovi-apple-tv-4k-homepod-mini-quasi-pronti-siri-aggiornata-attesa\",\"title\":\"Nuovi Apple TV 4K e HomePod mini “quasi pronti”: Siri aggiornata attesa\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Mark Gurman, Apple TV 4K e HomePod mini sarebbero pronti da mesi, ma il lancio slitterebbe finché non arriva Siri più personalizzata.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/HomePod-mini-and-Apple-TV-Sage-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"HomePod-mini-and-Apple-TV-Sage\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15200,\"date\":\"2026-05-28T18:35:52+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-28T12:38:11+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-aggiorna-valori-trade-in-iphone-ipad-mac-apple-watch\",\"title\":\"Apple aggiorna i valori di trade-in per iPhone, iPad, Mac e Apple Watch\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple aggiorna le stime di trade-in negli Stati Uniti: aumenti per molti iPhone, iPad e Apple Watch, cambi misti per i Mac e tagli per diverse offerte Android.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/apple-trade-in-2024-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"apple-trade-in-2024\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea 